  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Normally when the camera is spawned out it's possible to hold the mousewheel to rotate and fly around. If in third person view AND having locked the avatar rotation with pressing Tab, then once the camera is spawned out again it won't be possible to rotate the view with mwheel.",
